%description:
Tests the black-hole detection of the path MTU search with mtuProbing = 1, as
Linux tcp_mtu_probing() (RFC 4821 section 7.7). Both hosts are LinuxTcp with an
MSS of 1460, and the path drops each packet larger than 1100 bytes without an
ICMP error, so each data segment is lost. The search waits, with bounds from the
base MSS (1024, MTU 1076) to 1500. The timeouts come after 0.204, 0.408 and
0.816 s. At the fourth one, the retransmissions last 3.07 s, longer than R1, the
time of 3 retransmissions at the minimum RTO of 200 ms (Linux tcp_retries1 and
tcp_model_timeout(): 3 s). This is a black hole: the search starts, and the MSS
falls to the base MSS before the retransmission, which gets through (B016).

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 8s
*.srv_app.sendScript="1.0 40000"
*.*_tcp.typename = "LinuxTcp"
*.srv_tcp.mss = 1460
*.cli_tcp.mss = 1460
*.*_tcp.delayedAcksEnabled = false
*.srv_tcp.mtuProbing = 1
*.tcptester.pathMtu = 1100
*.srv_tcp.pathMtu = 1500

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[2.439 B015] A.1000 < B.2000: A 501:1949(1448) ack 1 win 16   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(2438,4)# dropping, larger than the path MTU
[4.071 B016] A.1000 < B.2000: A 501:1525(1024) ack 1 win 16   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(4070,4)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: the path MTU search waits for a black hole to run from 1076 to 1500, the route MTU is 1500
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: a black hole after 3.07s of retransmissions, the path MTU search starts
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: snd_mss is 1036, the search runs from 1076 to 1500
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Performing retransmission #4; increasing RTO from 1.632s  to 3.264s, and cancelling RTT measurement
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
